daripada awak untuk diagihkan?

05:22.950 --> 05:23.950
Tak.

05:24.720 --> 05:25.950
Tapi, bubur hari ini

05:26.270 --> 05:27.720
memang agak cair.

05:28.430 --> 05:30.960
Minta tuan sediakan
lebih banyak beras esok.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.270
Baik.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.000
Tuan,

05:34.159 --> 05:35.490
bubur dah siap dimasak.

05:41.240 --> 05:41.870
Semua,

05:42.040 --> 05:42.900
bubur dah siap.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.820
Cepat datang ambil bubur.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.190
Sabar.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.510
Sabar.

05:52.830 --> 05:53.830
Perlahan-lahan.

05:53.830 --> 05:54.890
Semua boleh dapat.

05:55.510 --> 05:56.750
Saya faham,

05:57.390 --> 05:59.070
